Dataset: Donate-a-Cry Corpus

This project uses the Donate-a-Cry Corpus dataset for infant cry classification.

Dataset source:
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/warcoder/donateacry-corpus

Total audio samples: 457

Steps to download dataset:
1. Go to the Kaggle link above
2. Download the dataset
3. Extract it
4. Place the folder inside the dataset directory

Dataset Distribution:

 Class          Number of Files 

belly_pain         16 
burping            8 
discomfort         27
hungry             382 
tired              24 
